{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0005", "block": 5, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "17a9660d720ffb1b", "text": "Slide 3"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0006", "block": 6, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 31, "sha256": "40a9c672359691d7", "text": "Hi! Who am I? What is Graphite?"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0007", "block": 7, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "a23fc624f35c7a91", "text": "Slide 4"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0008", "block": 8, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 106, "sha256": "216dbdb13a829e79", "text": "Graphite is the AI-powered code review platform helping developers create, review, and merge code changes."}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0009", "block": 9, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "a8e0f4f2a6b7b45f", "text": "Slide 5"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0010", "block": 10, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 203, "sha256": "36f567e13d10e1b0", "text": "The AI-native code review platform INTRODUCTION Our AI agent can answer questions about the PR. It is fully codebase aware. It can also propose updates, helping reviewers quickly resolve comments and CI."}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0011", "block": 11, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "d1ded820a6e11d6d", "text": "Slide 6"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0012", "block": 12, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 682, "sha256": "e87e13ab00bf61d5", "text": "A best-in-class code review platform built on-top of GitHub. Graphite provides a streamlined interface to create, review, and merge PRs, instantly and bi-directionally synced with GitHub. Trusted by the developers and companies you already know. We’re fortunate enough to collaborate with some of the biggest names in technology, and improve developer velocity across a wide swath of metrics. Conﬁdential INTRODUCTION Graphite at a glance Graphite helps engineers ship more. +33% Increase in PRs shipped per developer after adopting Graphite at Shopify 100,000s+ Trusted by 100,000s of developers at 1,000s of organizations +21% LoC/eng at Asana -74% Time between PRs merged at Ramp"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0013", "block": 13, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "8815c82be2b5d212", "text": "Slide 7"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0014", "block": 14, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 54, "sha256": "5280d4b55fdce3a6", "text": "Collaborating with humans How developers work together"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0015", "block": 15, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "ebd76fa557bf3349", "text": "Slide 8"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0016", "block": 16, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 392, "sha256": "f44046cc81082b06", "text": "COLLABORATING WITH HUMANS How developers collaborate A developer proposes a set of code changes, this atomic unit is called a pull request . (a.k.a. diff, patch, changelist, or merge request) The original developer merges their pull request back into the codebase. CREATE REVIEW MERGE Another developer reﬁnes (suggests improvements) through comments and ultimately approves the pull request."}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0017", "block": 17, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 7, "sha256": "c18fb98ca654a9d5", "text": "Slide 9"}
{"slug": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite", "id": "fall2025-w07-fri11-7-tomas-reimers-cpo-graphite#b0018", "block": 18, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 110, "sha256": "9eae555e0263cbce", "text": "AI means more code than ever is being created, but that also means more code needs to be reviewed and merged ."}
